  "layout": "The page is an asymmetric, masonry-flavored grid of themed cards on an Obsidian canvas. The hero is a single full-width Cream Paper panel (one card spanning the grid) containing the Portrait wordmark and a two-column meta block beneath. Below the hero, the layout breaks into a responsive 3-column card grid that itself becomes the navigation: each card is a destination, and the chromatic fills form a color-coded index. Cards are not uniform in height — a tall Cream Panel sits next to a shorter Charcoal card next to a full-bleed Solar Yellow thesis block. Column gaps are ~20px, row gaps are ~25–40px, and the outer page is centered within a 1280px max-width container. Section breaks are achieved with 80px of empty Obsidian space, never with a divider line.",
